[2026-02-02T19:46:24.804+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:24 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.ilpiacenza.it/eventi/al-via-ritorno-al-futuro-a-borgonovo-il-progetto-intergenerazionale-tra-studenti-e-anziani.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
