[2026-02-02T19:47:04.485+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:47:04 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.ilpiacenza.it/eventi/e-stata-tutta-vita-a-podenzano-la-presentazione-del-libro-di-valentina-mastroianni.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
